description:
Instantly gain 5 stacks of |cffffffffFlamecasting|r and then empower all nearby allies with magical fire, increasing their movement speed by $s1% for $d.

While under the effects of |cffffffffEmberheart|R direct damage dealt by allies deals ${$680366m1*$<scalingbp>+$spfi*.35} additional Fire damage.
@s:804301:0@

Activate a |cffffffffFetid Ward|r on yourself and your Undead minions for $d.

While active, $s1% of your damage dealt heals you and your minions, split evenly amongst them, and healing received is increased by $s2%.

@ext:Only 1 |cffffffffWard|r can be active at a time.:ext@

Reduces the cast time of |cffffffffMoonwell Splash|r by $s1% for $680821d, stacking $680821u times.

While this is active, |cffffffffMoonwell Splash|r is castable while moving.

@ext:Stacks are not removed while Lunar Eclipse is active.:ext@

Increases your magic penetration by $s1 for $d, stacking $u times. 

At $u stacks, your damaging abilties become infused with fire dealing an additional $681311s2% of the damage dealt instantly as Fire Damage and sundering your target and an additional nearby enemy.
@s:681307:0@

Activate a |cffffffffFetid Ward|r on yourself and your Undead minions for $d.

While active, healing taken is increased by $s2% and $s2% of your damage dealt heals you and your minions, split evenly amongst them.

@ext:Only 1 |cffffffffWard|r can be active at a time.:ext@
